# EmuDESK regression (in-kernel desktop, no #Z, NEWDESK.INF without open
# windows = newdesk-evb-desk.inf, the DESK50 run-A layout): double-click the
# C drive icon (38,30) -> C:\ window; double-click the folder at (95,100) in
# it (the APPS folder at that slot); hover the "View" title (135,9) ->
# drop-down; click "Show as text" (170,44) -> the window lists as text.
# Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py).
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
600 move 38 30
800 down
803 up
808 down
811 up
2200 mark B_DRIVE_OPEN
2400 move 95 100
2600 down
2603 up
2608 down
2611 up
4000 mark C_FOLDER_OPEN
4200 move 135 9
4600 mark D_VIEW_OPEN
4700 move 170 44
4900 down
4903 up
5800 mark E_MENU_CLICKED
6000 parkbr
6400 mark END
